-- Doors of a labelled simplex: the faces whose labels are exactly
-- 0, …, n − 1.  A completely labelled simplex has one door; any other
-- simplex has none or two
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
